# UV
# uv.lock is deliberately TRACKED. This is an application installed straight from
# git+https://…, so the lock is the only thing pinning the transitive tree a user
# actually gets; untracked, every install resolves fresh against PyPI. Regenerate with
# `uv lock` and commit it alongside the pyproject.toml change that caused it.

